00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you know what
I'm talking about?

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It's
really stressing me out.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, your fans are upset
because, apparently,

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:14.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
