00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
And fans are heartbroken.
People are upset.

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:21.254 align:start size:94% position:6%
No one knows what to say.
What is going on?

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
What -- The gap is gone?
What's up?

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Well, first of all,
the fact that this is

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:29.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
a newsworthy event
in our world right now

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:34.501 line:92%
is pretty Chaka Khan to me

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Chaka Khan.
-Chaka Khan.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.203 line:92%
-Yeah, why is everyone upset

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:43.176
-Well, so I had a permanen
retainer since I was like 13

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was just glued
to the back of my teeth.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:48.181
And I was having a lot of
neck problems recently,

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:51.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
so my orthodontist --
she decided that it would be

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:54.654
a good idea to take it off and
see if my jaw sort of expanded

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:57.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it helped me,
and my gap closed by itself.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:01.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm really
sad about it, too.

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:02.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, wait, wait.
Hold on a second.

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
First of all,
you got to walk me back.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:06.933 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Your neck bothered you,

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so that's what made yo
take the retainer

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:09.903 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
out of your mouth?

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, is that a thing?
Has anyone ever heard of that?

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. That is a real thing.
Yeah.

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:15.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So if your neck bothers you
it might be your teeth?

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:18.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, as you grow
as a human being, your...

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:18.945 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Uh-huh.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:22.649
-...your skull expands and
your jaw and your teeth move

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, your teeth
don't look like they did

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:25.952 size:78% position:39% line:92%
