00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:29.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They do, actually.
I was born...

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:33.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was born with veneers.
-Oh. Cool. Cool.

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I broke this tooth.
This one is fake.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.430 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Let me feel it.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's not going to
feel different.

00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:42.102
It feels like a tooth.
-Not if you go like this.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:45.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can you hear that?
-It sounds like a tooth.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:53.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's like when knock on a
hollow part of a wall.

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:57.217 size:84% position:42%
-Is that one fake, too?
-Are they both fake?

00:01:57.217 --> 00:01:58.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All my teeth are fake.
Yeah, actually.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.654
This one might be fake, as well.
Yeah. That's weird.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-But let me tap on your tooth.

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:07.827 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:10.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You don't have any nails.
-Yeah. I don't have any nails.

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:13.800
I know.
I took them off before the show.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:17.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to talk to you --
-Anyway, hold on.

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:18.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
