-Yeah.

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:19.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sad about my
gap tooth, too.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:23.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'd really appreciate som
privacy in this time --

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:23.843 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
