00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:26.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
First of all, don't demand -
don't demand --

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:30.016 size:78% position:39%
Don't clap for that.
Don't demand or clap.

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:32.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
You demand some privacy?
-Yeah.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:33.153 line:92%
-I think it looks beautiful.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:36.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I have to deal with
a whole new world of problems.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.893
-No.
-Getting food stuck in my tooth.

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:40.627 size:84% position:42% line:92%
