00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:45.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, because before, it woul
just slide right through.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.233 line:92%
-So your whole life has changed,

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
