00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:49.536 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:49.536 --> 00:02:51.504
-Just as much as the public an
your fans are dealing with -

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:54.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, but it's
going to come back.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
